Package: welltrack2
Title: WellTrack 2.0 - Decision-Centric Well Intervention Process
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Frenk", "Giorgetti", email = "frenk.giorgetti@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny application that manages well intervention opportunities
    (workover, well service, initial completion) along a configurable,
    decision-centric process: Opportunity, D1 Pursue, Technical Assurance,
    Value and Investment, D2 Invest, Prepare and Readiness, D3 Execute,
    Execute, Verify Value and Learn. The process is defined in YAML.
